  "question": "When you take the photo of the finished box, what specific details must be clearly readable on the label to prove it matches the grade of the coil you just rolled?",
  "asks_about": "evidence",
  "unresolved": [
    "Length tolerance (shop does not have a number)",
    "Visual defect limits for tears and wrinkles (shop goes by eye with no written spec)"
