  "understanding": "We are re-rolling 321 and 309 stainless steel foil into retail rolls, where keeping the grades separate is critical to prevent customer tools from scaling. Operators wear cut gloves, verify the parent coil's mill tag against the order, and take photos of both the mill tag with the roll and the labeled box before sealing."
